# Design system

This file used to hold 471 lines of design rules that contradicted
.github/copilot-instructions.md, CLAUDE.md and the actual stylesheet on nearly
every decision — blue, the primary accent, buttons, card backgrounds, radius and
emoji. That disagreement is why the site was built inconsistently.

There is now one source of truth:

    DESIGN.md

Read it before changing any styling. Do not restate its rules here — a second
copy is how the contradictions started.

Project context lives in CLAUDE.md.
